<title>USA: Nationwide Financial to tap corp bond mart.</title>
<headline>Nationwide Financial to tap corp bond mart.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nationwide Financial Services Inc is expected to issue a $400 million two-part debt offering, syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The first tranche is expected to consist of $300 million in A1/A-plus 30-year debt, callable after 10 years, sources said.</p>
<p>The second tranche is expected to consist of $100 million in A1/A rated 40-year capital securities, sources added.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be launched today and priced on Tuesday, they added.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
